---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Kernel Contributions — Aravind Anilraj (phi5ic)"
  description="Patches submitted to the Linux kernel upstream across sound and thermal subsystems."
>
  <div class="space-y-10 font-mono">
    <!-- Header -->
    <header class="border border-[#2a0e2e] bg-[#100613] p-4 sm:p-5 rounded-sm space-y-1">
      <div class="text-[11px] text-[#854d80]">phi5ic@kernel ~ $ git log --author="Aravind Anilraj"</div>
      <h1 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight flex items-center gap-2">
        <span>Linux Kernel Contributions</span>
        <span class="text-[#00ff66] text-xs font-normal">[6 merged upstream]</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xs text-[#c9a6c5]">
        Patches submitted, reviewed, and merged into upstream Linux across ASoC (sound) and Thermal subsystems.
      </p>
    </header>

    <!-- Verification / Archive links -->
    <section class="bg-[#100613] border border-[#2a0e2e] rounded-sm p-3.5 text-xs text-[#ecd2e8] space-y-2">
      <div class="text-white font-bold flex items-center gap-2">
        <span class="text-[#ff2a85]">&gt;</span> Upstream Verification &amp; Public Archives:
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-x-4 gap-y-2 text-[#ff2a85]">
        <a href="https://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/linux/kernel/git/rafael/linux-pm.git/log/?qt=author&q=Aravind+Anilraj" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:text-[#ff79c6]">
          [rafael/linux-pm.git author commits &nearr;]
        </a>
        <a href="https://lore.kernel.org/all/?q=Aravind+Anilraj" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:text-[#ff79c6]">
          [lore.kernel.org archive search &nearr;]
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Merged Patches Table -->
    <section class="space-y-3">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-[#2a0e2e] pb-1.5">
        <h2 class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-[#ff2a85] font-bold">
          -- MERGED UPSTREAM PATCHES --
        </h2>
        <span class="text-xs text-[#00ff66] font-mono">[6 patches]</span>
      </div>

      <div class="overflow-x-auto border border-[#2a0e2e] rounded-sm">
        <table class="w-full text-left text-xs border-collapse">
          <thead>
            <tr class="bg-[#1a081e] border-b border-[#2a0e2e] text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider text-[#ff79c6]">
              <th class="py-2.5 px-3 font-semibold">Patch Description</th>
              <th class="py-2.5 px-3 font-semibold">Subsystem</th>
              <th class="py-2.5 px-3 font-semibold">Commit</th>
              <th class="py-2.5 px-3 font-semibold">Lore Thread</th>
              <th class="py-2.5 px-3 font-semibold whitespace-nowrap">Backport</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody class="divide-y divide-[#2a0e2e] text-xs">
            <tr class="hover:bg-[#150719] transition-colors">
              <td class="py-2.5 px-3 text-[#ecd2e8] font-medium">ASoC: bytcr_rt5640: fix MCLK resource leak</td>
              <td class="py-2.5 px-3 text-[#c9a6c5] whitespace-nowrap">ASoC / Intel</td>
              <td class="py-2.5 px-3 whitespace-nowrap font-mono text-[11px]">
                <a href="https://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/linux/kernel/git/broonie/sound.git/commit/?id=a02496a29463" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-[#ff2a85] hover:text-[#ff79c6]">
                  [a02496a29463 &nearr;]
                </a>
              </td>
              <td class="py-2.5 px-3 whitespace-nowrap text-[11px]">
                <a href="https://patch.msgid.link/20260401220507.23557-2-aravindanilraj0702@gmail.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-[#ff79c6] hover:underline">
                  [lore &nearr;]
                </a>
              </td>
              <td class="py-2.5 px-3 text-[#00ff66] whitespace-nowrap font-mono text-[11px]">5.10+</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="hover:bg-[#150719] transition-colors">
              <td class="py-2.5 px-3 text-[#ecd2e8] font-medium">ASoC: bytcr_rt5651: fix MCLK resource leak</td>
              <td class="py-2.5 px-3 text-[#c9a6c5] whitespace-nowrap">ASoC / Intel</td>
              <td class="py-2.5 px-3 whitespace-nowrap font-mono text-[11px]">
                <a href="https://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/linux/kernel/git/broonie/sound.git/commit/?id=b022e5c142ef" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-[#ff2a85] hover:text-[#ff79c6]">
                  [b022e5c142ef &nearr;]
                </a>
              </td>
              <td class="py-2.5 px-3 whitespace-nowrap text-[11px]">
                <a href="https://patch.msgid.link/20260401220507.23557-3-aravindanilraj0702@gmail.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-[#ff79c6] hover:underline">
                  [lore &nearr;]
                </a>
              </td>
              <td class="py-2.5 px-3 text-[#00ff66] whitespace-nowrap font-mono text-[11px]">5.10+</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="hover:bg-[#150719] transition-colors">
              <td class="py-2.5 px-3 text-[#ecd2e8] font-medium">ASoC: cht_bsw_rt5672: fix MCLK resource leak</td>
              <td class="py-2.5 px-3 text-[#c9a6c5] whitespace-nowrap">ASoC / Intel</td>
              <td class="py-2.5 px-3 whitespace-nowrap font-mono text-[11px]">
                <a href="https://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/linux/kernel/git/broonie/sound.git/commit/?id=dced5a373a96" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-[#ff2a85] hover:text-[#ff79c6]">
                  [dced5a373a96 &nearr;]
                </a>
              </td>
              <td class="py-2.5 px-3 whitespace-nowrap text-[11px]">
                <a href="https://patch.msgid.link/20260401220507.23557-4-aravindanilraj0702@gmail.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-[#ff79c6] hover:underline">
                  [lore &nearr;]
                </a>
              </td>
              <td class="py-2.5 px-3 text-[#00ff66] whitespace-nowrap font-mono text-[11px]">5.10+</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="hover:bg-[#150719] transition-colors">
              <td class="py-2.5 px-3 text-[#ecd2e8] font-medium">ASoC: Standardize MCLK error logs across RT boards</td>
              <td class="py-2.5 px-3 text-[#c9a6c5] whitespace-nowrap">ASoC / Intel</td>
              <td class="py-2.5 px-3 whitespace-nowrap font-mono text-[11px]">
                <a href="https://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/linux/kernel/git/broonie/sound.git/commit/?id=85c38c2fa17d" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-[#ff2a85] hover:text-[#ff79c6]">
                  [85c38c2fa17d &nearr;]
                </a>
              </td>
              <td class="py-2.5 px-3 whitespace-nowrap text-[11px]">
                <a href="https://patch.msgid.link/20260401220507.23557-5-aravindanilraj0702@gmail.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-[#ff79c6] hover:underline">
                  [lore &nearr;]
                </a>
              </td>
              <td class="py-2.5 px-3 text-[#854d80] whitespace-nowrap font-mono text-[11px]">&mdash;</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="hover:bg-[#150719] transition-colors">
              <td class="py-2.5 px-3 text-[#ecd2e8] font-medium">thermal: intel: int340x: Fix potential shift overflow in ptc_mmio_write</td>
              <td class="py-2.5 px-3 text-[#c9a6c5] whitespace-nowrap">Thermal / Intel int340x</td>
              <td class="py-2.5 px-3 whitespace-nowrap font-mono text-[11px]">
                <a href="https://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/linux/kernel/git/rafael/linux-pm.git/commit/?id=8aa807a89dccdff4bcfc0cfc459b1ba714badbb6" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-[#ff2a85] hover:text-[#ff79c6]">
                  [8aa807a89dcc &nearr;]
                </a>
              </td>
              <td class="py-2.5 px-3 whitespace-nowrap text-[11px]">
                <a href="https://patch.msgid.link/20260329070642.10721-2-aravindanilraj0702@gmail.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-[#ff79c6] hover:underline">
                  [lore &nearr;]
                </a>
              </td>
              <td class="py-2.5 px-3 text-[#e0af68] whitespace-nowrap font-mono text-[11px]">&mdash; (rc7.2)</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="hover:bg-[#150719] transition-colors">
              <td class="py-2.5 px-3 text-[#ecd2e8] font-medium">thermal: intel: int340x: Check return value of ptc_create_groups()</td>
              <td class="py-2.5 px-3 text-[#c9a6c5] whitespace-nowrap">Thermal / Intel int340x</td>
              <td class="py-2.5 px-3 whitespace-nowrap font-mono text-[11px]">
                <a href="https://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/linux/kernel/git/rafael/linux-pm.git/commit/?id=8aa807a89dccdff4bcfc0cfc459b1ba714badbb6" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-[#ff2a85] hover:text-[#ff79c6]">
                  [8aa807a89dcc &nearr;]
                </a>
              </td>
              <td class="py-2.5 px-3 whitespace-nowrap text-[11px]">
                <a href="https://patch.msgid.link/20260329070642.10721-3-aravindanilraj0702@gmail.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-[#ff79c6] hover:underline">
                  [lore &nearr;]
                </a>
              </td>
              <td class="py-2.5 px-3 text-[#e0af68] whitespace-nowrap font-mono text-[11px]">&mdash; (rc7.2)</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Reviewers & Maintainers -->
    <section class="space-y-2 border-t border-[#2a0e2e] pt-4">
      <h2 class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-[#854d80] font-bold">
        -- REVIEWERS &amp; MAINTAINERS --
      </h2>
      <ul class="space-y-1.5 text-xs text-[#c9a6c5]">
        <li>
          <strong class="text-white">&gt; Mark Brown</strong> <span class="text-[#854d80]">&mdash; ASoC subsystem maintainer (Signed-off-by, committed to sound.git)</span>
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong class="text-white">&gt; Cezary Rojewski</strong> <span class="text-[#854d80]">&mdash; Intel ASoC driver lead (Reviewed-by)</span>
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong class="text-white">&gt; Rafael J. Wysocki</strong> <span class="text-[#854d80]">&mdash; Linux Power Management &amp; Thermal maintainer (Signed-off-by, committed to linux-pm.git)</span>
        </li>
      </ul>
